{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/InMemoryDestination\/deliveries"},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"deliveries","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncQueue","preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV","identifier":"doc:\/\/AsyncQueues\/documentation\/AsyncQueues\/AsyncQueue","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<[","kind":"text"},{"text":"EventRecord","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events11EventRecordV","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventRecord","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]> { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Batches not yet read wait in a buffer of the newest ","type":"text"},{"code":"capacity","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" batches; a slower reader","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"misses the older ones, and reads ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/InMemoryDestination\/records","isActive":true},{"text":" for what is kept. The sequence ends once the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"destination and every copy of it are gone and every batch kept has been read.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"One task reads the batches at a time; it can fan each one out to the rest of the app. The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"first iterator to read holds them until its iteration ends or it is released; a second","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reader meanwhile waits its turn, logging a warning once, then reads on from the next batch,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so the first gets every batch in order. A reader cancelled while it waits returns ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/destinations\/inmemorydestination\/deliveries"]}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"property","remoteSource":{"fileName":"InMemoryDestination.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Destinations\/InMemoryDestination.swift#L108"},"externalID":"s:12Destinations19InMemoryDestinationV10deliveries11AsyncQueues0F5QueueVySay6Events11EventRecordVGGvp","roleHeading":"Instance Property","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"deliveries","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncQueue","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV"},{"text":"<[","kind":"text"},{"text":"EventRecord","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events11EventRecordV"},{"text":"]>","kind":"text"}],"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"Destinations"}],"title":"deliveries"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations","doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/InMemoryDestination"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"Each batch as it is received, whole, for a reader that waits for a delivery: a view that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"refreshes, or a test that reads once a batch arrives.","type":"text"}],"references":{"doc://Destinations/documentation/Destinations/InMemoryDestination":{"url":"\/documentation\/destinations\/inmemorydestination","identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/InMemoryDestination","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A destination that keeps the newest records it receives, in memory, for the app to read."}],"type":"topic","fragment